          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Description: On June 3, 2013, around 11:30 PM, a witness and his wife observed fixed lights forming a triangle and thought it was an airplane, but the lights approached and the witness distinguished between them a dark, flat shape. Only one statement was collected. This case was deemed strange enough by the GEIPAN to warrant an investigator for a field inquiry. This observation case proves to be very consistent, with two non-independent witnesses and a low-quality video, leaving no doubt about the reality of the phenomenon, and with a good estimate of its apparent trajectory. The strangeness of the case turns out to be low as it is consistent with the behavior of various well-known flying objects. Despite a few unexplained points (see the investigation report), the observed aspect is consistent with that of a group of helicopters.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "cffb35b6de29e782c10d6e2b2802114eb7c8bb002629a0b3a957a02afa3cf4c6"
        }
